    "description": "The target becomes a size 4 giant serpent, as long as a sanctuary and weighing 500 kg to 8 tonnes. It gains 20 temporary HP, Protection 2, Strength +6 (and +6 damage), Fear Factor 1d5, Paralysing Gaze, and Constriction. Its natural attacks are a bite (2d10, Open Roll 9–10) and a crush after a successful constriction (2d10, ignoring armour protection). Its equipment is suspended; it cannot wield weapons or use other divine powers than those granted by this form.",
